>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `aesop_ss`

``` hol4
aesopData.aesop_ss : unit -> simpExtLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Returns Aesop's simplifier default for the ambient context.

The simpset is `srw_ss ()`, lifted into the extension engine by
`simpExtLib.lift_simpset`, with weakened conditional congruence,
eta-reduction (`boolSimps.ETA_ss`), conditional depth 40, the safe solver
`clasimpLib.safe_solver`, and the unsafe solver
`linarith_solver_with_facts` over the context's
[`[arith]`](#linarithData.arith) facts. The context's `[aesop_simp]`
rewrites are added. It has no case splitter
([`simpExtLib.split_ss`](#simpExtLib.split_ss)); splitting is left to the
search. Changes to `srw_ss ()` carry over; scope a temporary one with
`BasicProvers.with_simpset_updates`.

### Failure

Fails if the context's `srw_ss` has no `"CONG"` fragment, e.g. after
[`BasicProvers.diminish_srw_ss ["CONG"]`](#BasicProvers.diminish_srw_ss).

